  "content": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "Consider the grammar:"
    },
    {
      "type": "formula",
      "value": "$$\nS  A a A | C A | B a B\\tag{20}\n$$",
      "format": "latex"
    },
    {
      "type": "formula",
      "value": "$$\nA  a a B a \\vert C D A \\vert a a \\vert D C\n$$",
      "format": "latex"
    },
    {
      "type": "formula",
      "value": "$$\nC  C a { \\big | } b C { \\big | } D\n$$",
      "format": "latex"
    },
    {
      "type": "formula",
      "value": "$$\nD  b D  \\varepsilon \n$$",
      "format": "latex"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "i) Eliminate ε-productions,"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "ii) Eliminate unit productions from the resulting grammar from (i),"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "iii) Eliminate useless productions from the resulting grammar from (ii),"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "value": "iv) Convert the grammar from (iii) into Chomsky Normal Form."
    }
  ],
